@UnitConversationAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5206

### Get supported units
GET {{UnitConversationAPI_HostAddress}}/api/conversion/units
Accept: application/json

### Convert kilometers to meters
POST {{UnitConversationAPI_HostAddress}}/api/conversion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 10,
  "fromUnit": "km",
  "toUnit": "m"
}
